OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over parking meter plans
OL,4,Afor city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised over plans to
OL,7,Fintroduce parking meters and a new
OL,8,Fon-street parking system to "help
OL,9,Fmanage parking and traffic movement" in
OL,10,Fa city.
OL,12,FThe proposal by Cornwall Council for
OL,13,FTruro has been supported by Truro's
OL,14,FBusiness Improvement District - and
OL,15,Fsome residents fear the changes would
OL,16,Fpush more people to park in residential
OL,17,Fareas.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
