OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over parking meter plans
OL,4,Afor city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity councillors also raised concerns,
OL,7,Fincluding possible damage to Truro's
OL,8,Fhistoric granite setts, some of which
OL,9,Fwould have to be cut or removed for the
OL,10,Fequipment.
OL,12,FCouncillor Dan Rogerson, portfolio
OL,13,Fholder for transport, said the plans
OL,14,Faimed to "protect the current free
OL,15,Fparking" so businesses were not
OL,16,Fimpacted. A public consultation ends on
OL,17,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
